This firmware speaks the Panasonic CZ-TACG1 / CN-CNT UART protocol.
The frame format, checksum and field values are derived from:

  esphome-panasonic-ac
  https://github.com/DomiStyle/esphome-panasonic-ac
  Copyright (c) 2020 Dominik
  MIT License

The Zigbee thermostat, router role, factory reset and OTA client follow the
structure of:

  esp32-midea-ac
  https://github.com/pirsasha/esp32-midea-ac
  Apache License 2.0

and the public Espressif esp-zigbee-sdk examples, also Apache License 2.0.
The Panasonic UART port and the Zigbee glue in this repository are new code.
This project does not include the Midea UART protocol.
